## AD Lab

Active Directory environment (Windows Server + AD DS) simulating full user lifecycle management — onboarding, offboarding, OU structure, group policy, permissions troubleshooting, and account recovery.

- **Status:** ✅ Finished
- **Tools:** `Windows Server 2022`, `AD DS`, `GPO`, `VirtualBox`
- 📄 [Full documentation](ad-lab/README.md)

---

## Ticketing System

Self-hosted ticketing system (`osTicket`) with realistic support tickets spanning hardware, software, network, and access categories. Includes triage priority logic and resolution documentation.

- **Status:** 🔄 In progress
- **Tools:** `osTicket`, `Ubuntu Server 26.04`, `Apache2`, `MySQL 8.4`, `PHP 8.5`
- 📄 [Full documentation](ticketing-system/README.md)

---

## Runbook

Diagnostic runbook for common end-user issues — symptom-based troubleshooting trees for boot failures, network drops, printing, blue screens, performance, login issues, and software crashes.

- **Status:** 🔄 In progress
- **Format:** Markdown, one doc per symptom category

